; groupdef.dir/arenaowner  (Dare.Arenas)
; Owner of a player-owned arena. Granted arena-scoped only (staff.conf [<arena>] Player = arenaowner)
; by the Dare.Arenas module; never global, and never to global staff (they get the owner commands
; from groupdef.dir/arenastaff instead). The [arenaowner] section in groupdef.conf also includes
; groupdef.dir/default and groupdef.dir/arenacaps.
;
; NEVER add cmd_quickfix or changesettings to this file, arenamod or arenacaps: the server's
; ?quickfix checks "changesettings", and that capability edits svs.conf and every other shared
; file zone-wide with no allow-list. Owners change settings with ?arenaset or the web page.

; owner commands (Dare.Arenas)
cmd_arenaset
cmd_arenaget
cmd_comod
; map upload is ?arenamap, NOT ?putmap: never grant cmd_putmap to owners. The core AdminCommand
; module registers ?putmap too; it writes maps/uploads/ with no size limit and would run as well.
cmd_arenamap
cmd_putlvz
cmd_rmlvz
cmd_weblogin
cmd_bots
